{"id":"n63635-1-6","stage":4,"title":"소식 · 少量进食","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63635-1-6-1","ko":"소식을 하는 사람이 장수한다는 연구 결과가 있대요.","zh":"听说有研究表明，吃得少的人比较长寿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소식을","meaning":"少量进食","explanation":"소식：少量进食；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소식","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63635","senseId":"1","lemma":"소식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"吃，喝","explanation":"하다：吃，喝；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장수한다는","meaning":"长寿","explanation":"장수하다：长寿；ㄴ다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"장수하다","audio":"/audio/07073e827ade1089eac6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73607","senseId":"1","lemma":"장수하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연구","meaning":"研究","explanation":"연구：研究","readings":[{"term":"연구","audio":"/audio/a0eadd0b05bc2ecac43d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62879","senseId":"1","lemma":"연구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결과가","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있대요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"648fb8dfcf63ca8c","term":"소식","zh":"少量进食","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3","entryId":"63635","definition":"少吃食物。","pronunciation":["소ː식"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"吃，喝","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进食或抽烟等。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"07073e827ade1089","term":"장수하다","zh":"长寿","audio":"/audio/07073e827ade1089eac6.mp3","entryId":"73607","definition":"活得很久。","pronunciation":["장수하다"]},{"id":"a0eadd0b05bc2eca","term":"연구","zh":"研究","audio":"/audio/a0eadd0b05bc2ecac43d.mp3","entryId":"62879","definition":"为查明与某个事物或事情相关的事实而对此仔细调查分析的事情。","pronunciation":["연ː구"]},{"id":"109383e344db8ae5","term":"결과","zh":"结果，结局","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3","entryId":"60093","definition":"某件事情或过程结束后的状态或现象。","pronunciation":["결과"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f10b821cb34bb9362323.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63635-1-6-2","ko":"정말요? 그럼 밥을 조금씩 먹는 습관을 들여야겠네요.","zh":"是吗？那得养成每次少吃一点的习惯了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말요?","meaning":"真的，事实，真话","explanation":"정말：真的，事实，真话；요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금씩","meaning":"一点点","explanation":"조금：一点点；씩：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61177","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹는","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"습관을","meaning":"习惯","explanation":"습관：习惯；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"습관","audio":"/audio/04694ae7655dfa6742aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65105","senseId":"1","lemma":"습관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들여야겠네요.","meaning":"花费，付出","explanation":"들이다：花费，付出；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"들이다","audio":"/audio/d301b4f8af6e22a42158.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15078","senseId":"9","lemma":"들이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的，事实，真话","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"没有虚假的实情；或指与实情毫无差错的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61177","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"04694ae7655dfa67","term":"습관","zh":"习惯","audio":"/audio/04694ae7655dfa6742aa.mp3","entryId":"65105","definition":"在长时间重复的过程中自然熟悉的行动方式。","pronunciation":["습꽌"]},{"i